<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:20.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">Enable or disable cookies and delete cookies</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">By using our website, you agree to the Personalized Cookie Package.&nbsp;You can withdraw your consent and opt for the Essential Cookie Package instead.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">Personalized cookie package</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">Thuisbezorgd.nl and affiliated third parties show you personalized advertisements, which we believe are relevant to you.&nbsp;Our website works as you would expect.&nbsp;We use functional cookies, such as storing what was in your shopping cart at a specific restaurant.&nbsp;We use analytical cookies to see how we can improve the website.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">Essential cookie package</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">Thuisbezorgd.nl and affiliated third parties can show you advertisements.&nbsp;However, these will not be based on your interests or product preferences.&nbsp;Our website works as you would expect.&nbsp;For this we use functional cookies, for example to store what was in your shopping basket at a certain restaurant.&nbsp;We use analytical cookies to see how we can improve the website.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:20.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">What Technologies do we use?</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">As mentioned above, we use various Technologies for the collection of data.&nbsp;For example, we use scripts, trackers and cookies.&nbsp;Below the technologies used will be explained to you.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">1.&nbsp;<em>What is a script?</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">A script is a piece of code that is used to make our website function properly and interactive.&nbsp;This code can be executed on our server or on your equipment.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">2.&nbsp;<em>What is a tracker?</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">A tracker is a small, invisible piece of text or image on our website that is used to map the traffic on our website.&nbsp;To map traffic, we use multiple trackers that each store different data about you.&nbsp;We may also have third parties place trackers on our website to monitor traffic on our website for us.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">3.&nbsp;<em>What are cookies?</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">A cookie is a simple small text file that is sent along with pages of our website and stored by your web browser on the hard drive of your computer.&nbsp;Some cookies only help to make the link between your activities on our website with one website visit.&nbsp;Other cookies remain stored on the hard drive of your computer and will be sent back to our servers or those of third party who placed the cookie for us when you visit our website again.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">4.&nbsp;<em>What are social media buttons?</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">In addition to cookies, our websites also use social media buttons.&nbsp;These buttons are included to promote (&#39;like&#39;) or share (&#39;tweet&#39;) web pages on social networks such as Facebook, Twitter, Google+ and Youtube.&nbsp;These buttons work by means of pieces of code that come from Facebook, Twitter, Google + and Youtube itself.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:20.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">Why do we use these Technologies?</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">We place cookies, trackers and scripts for various purposes: functional, analytical and marketing purposes.&nbsp;Below you will find an overview of the different purposes for using the Technologies.&nbsp;For a specific overview of all technologies we use, the associated purposes and specific functions of the Technologies, please refer to our <a href="https://247drank.com/technologies">Technologies list</a></span></span>.&nbsp;<span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">This list is regularly updated by us to provide you with the most accurate overview as possible of the Technologies we use.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">1.&nbsp;<em>Functional purposes</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">We use various Technologies to ensure that our website functions properly and is easy to use.&nbsp;Scripts and cookies are used for this purpose.&nbsp;Scripts ensure that the website is interactive and that as soon as you click on something, something actually happens.&nbsp;Cookies are used to enable functions such as the shopping basket.&nbsp;Without cookies, the shopping basket would not be able to remember the products you have selected.&nbsp;Remembering your address is also a function that would not work without cookies.&nbsp;Some of the Technologies used for functional purposes are so essential for the operation of our website that they cannot be disabled.&nbsp;These Technologies will not be stored for more than a few hours after your website visit.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">2.&nbsp;<em>Analytical purposes</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">We analyse, by means of cookies and trackers, your behaviour on our website in order to be able to improve our website and adapt it to your wishes.&nbsp;In this way we hope to make our website as user-friendly as possible.&nbsp;For example, we keep track of which pages are visited the most and how you navigate on our website.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">3.&nbsp;<em>Marketing purposes</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">Of course, we hope that you use our website as often as possible and therefore use cookies and trackers to advertise.&nbsp;By means of cookies we can offer you interesting offers and/or discounts.&nbsp;For this purpose, we analyse, among other things, how often you use our website and which products you find interesting.&nbsp;This way we can better adapt our offer and advertisements to your wishes.&nbsp;Another marketing goal for which we use trackers is to check if you are from a website of one of our advertisers.&nbsp;This is necessary because we have to pay our advertisers for the customers who visit our website via their platform (or place an order on our platform).</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:20.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">Security of your data by us and by third parties</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">1.&nbsp;<em>Security of your data by 247DRANK</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">247DRANK takes the protection of your data seriously and takes appropriate measures to prevent misuse, loss, unauthorized access, unwanted disclosure and unauthorized modification.&nbsp;If you feel that your data is not properly secured or there are indications of abuse, please contact us at:&nbsp;</span></span><a href="mailto:security@247drank.com" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#0563c1">security@247drank.com</span></span></a><u>&nbsp;</u><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">2.&nbsp;<em>Third-party technologies</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">As previously mentioned, we use third-party technologies.&nbsp;These third parties help us achieve the stated purposes.&nbsp;We do not allow third parties to use your data for their own purposes or purposes that do not correspond to our purposes as described in this statement.&nbsp;We conclude processing agreements with third parties who post Technologies on our website on our behalf to ensure the same level of security and confidentiality of your data.&nbsp;We remain responsible for the processing of your personal data on behalf of 247DRANK.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:20.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">What are your rights?</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">1.&nbsp;<em>Enabling and disabling cookies and deleting cookies</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">You can always adjust your preferences regarding the Technologies (often referred to only as cookies on the Internet).&nbsp;It is also possible to delete cookies that have already been placed (this is the only Technology that stores data on your device).&nbsp;By disabling the Technologies, it is possible that parts of our website will no longer work.&nbsp;Essential Technologies for the operation of the website (including some scripts and cookies) cannot be deactivated.&nbsp;By clicking on one of the links below you will find how you can change your settings per browser and possibly delete your cookies:</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:Symbol"><span style="color:#666666">&middot;</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647?hl=nl" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#1574f5">Chrome</span></span></a></span></span><br />
