<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:Symbol"><span style="color:#666666">&middot;</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://support.microsoft.com/nl-nl/help/17442/windows-internet-explorer-delete-manage-cookies" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#1574f5">Internet Explorer</span></span></a></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:Symbol"><span style="color:#666666">&middot;</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://support.microsoft.com/nl-nl/help/10607/microsoft-edge-view-delete-browser-history" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#1574f5">Edge</span></span></a></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:Symbol"><span style="color:#666666">&middot;</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://support.apple.com/nl-nl/HT201265" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#1574f5">Safari (iOS)</span></span></a></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">2.&nbsp;<em>Right to access, correct or delete your data</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">You have the right to request access to and correction or deletion of your data (for more information, see our <a href="https://247drank.com/privacy_policy">privacy statement</a>.</span></span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">In order to prevent abuse, we may ask you to identify yourself adequately in the event of such a request.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">3.&nbsp;<em>Tips, questions and complaints</em></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">For more information about our privacy policy and the processing of your personal data, please refer to our <a href="https://247drank.com/privacy_policy">privacy statement</a>.</span></span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">If you have any questions or complaints regarding our cookie policy, we are happy to help you.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:#f0f0a0"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">This Cookie statement can be adjusted and was last amended on&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="background-color:#f0f0a0"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#0f0f5f">22 June 2020</span></span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="color:#666666">.</span></span></span></span><br />
