            [
                'id' => 5,
                'page_name' => 'Guaranteed Working Method Alcohol Law',
                'page_content_eng' => '<p><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-size:20.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Guaranteed working method alcohol law </span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">10 June 2023</span></span> </span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">It is very important for 247DRANK that alcohol is sold in a responsible manner, also online. 247DRANK absolutely does not want to sell alcohol to young people under the age of eighteen.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">This document provides insight into the way in which 247DRANK implements this responsible distance selling. This satisfies the requirement laid down in Article 20A(1)(b) of the Alcohol Act that a method must be used to ensure that the alcoholic beverage is delivered only to the address of the consignee or to a distribution point and that the age of the person to whom the alcoholic beverage is supplied is determined and that this method is also used.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">This document is always up to date. This means that the document is updated with every change in the situation and is reviewed annually. The document contains a description of: &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">the process used to monitor the age limit and comply with the applicable obligations;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">the way in which this method is made known and transparent to employees; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">checking the correct compliance with the process and the way in which any corrections are made.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">How 247DRANK, together with any chain partners (delivery services), monitors the age limit from ordering drinks to delivery; </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">How 247DRANK ensures that the working method is made clear and clear for employees, own delivery staff and/or others who work under the responsibility of 247DRANK. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">How 247DRANK checks for the correct compliance with the guaranteed working method and how, following evaluations of the working method, any changes are implemented. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span>

<h1 style="margin-left:1px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-size:18.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Process (in accordance with article 5.2, paragraph 1 under a and b of the Alcohol Decree) </span></span></span></span></span></span></h1>
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">For online orders, it is mandatory that the buyer indicates that he is at least 18 years and older. When confirming the order by telephone, it will be asked whether the buyer is 18 years or older. In all cases, the customer is also informed that upon delivery, the person who receives the drinks package must be 18 years or older </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">and must also identify himself if requested. During the ordering process there will be an IDIN check and/or 18+ confirmation. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Upon delivery by external delivery services, an age check will always be done. The recipient must show a valid identity document, in accordance with Article 20 paragraph 2 of the Alcohol Act. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">247DRANK&#39;s own delivery service checks the date of birth upon delivery on the basis of the delivery details and the ID document that you keep ready. If you have already been identified by previous checks of your own delivery person and you are recognized by your own delivery person and/or it is evident that you are older than 25 years, this can also be seen as verification. However, identification at the request of the delivery person remains mandatory at all times. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Delivery to the neighbors, or leaving drinks without anyone at home, is not allowed. The drinks package will be taken back by the delivery person. Upon own delivery, the drinks will be taken back and offered for delivery again. The additional costs are at the expense of the buyer. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;</span></span></span>

<h1 style="margin-left:1px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-size:18.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Provision of information to employees (in accordance with Article 5.2(1)(c) of the Alcohol Decree) </span></span></span></span></span></span></h1>
<span style="color:#595959; font-family:Century Gothic, sans-serif"><span style="font-size:11pt">All our employees are informed about this guaranteed working method by means of manuals, internal training and work </span><span style="font-size:14.6667px">consultations</span><span style="font-size:11pt">&nbsp;and are regularly checked for this.</span></span><br />
&nbsp;
<h1 style="margin-left:1px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-size:18.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Control (in accordance with Article 5.2(1)(d) of the Alcohol Decree) </span></span></span></span></span></span></h1>

<p><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Every month, the guaranteed working method is evaluated for all delivery drivers, both internally and externally, and adjusted where necessary. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">In the case of delivery by internal or external parties, random checks are carried out to ensure compliance with the required age check. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Want to know more about responsible alcohol consumption?<br />
nix18.nl<br />
STIVA.nl &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>',
                'page_content_dutch' => '<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-size:20.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Geborgde werkwijze alcoholwet </span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">10 Juni 2023</span></span> &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Het is voor 247DRANK van groot belang dat alcohol op een verantwoorde manier wordt verkocht, ook online. 247DRANK&nbsp; wil namelijk absoluut geen alcohol verkopen aan jongeren onder de achttien jaar. <strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Met dit document wordt inzicht gegeven in de manier waarop 247DRANK invulling geeft aan deze verantwoorde verkoop op afstand. Hiermee wordt voldaan aan de in artikel 20A lid 1 sub b van de Alcoholwet gestelde eis dat men moet beschikken over een werkwijze waarmee wordt gewaarborgd dat de alcoholhoudende drank slechts wordt afgeleverd op het adres van de geadresseerde of bij een distributiepunt en dat de leeftijd van de persoon aan wie de alcoholhoudende drank wordt verstrekt wordt vastgesteld en dat deze werkwijze ook wordt gehanteerd. <strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Dit document is altijd actueel. Dit betekent dat het document wordt geactualiseerd bij iedere wijziging van de situatie en jaarlijks wordt herzien. Het document bevat een omschrijving van:<strong> </strong>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span>
<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">het proces dat wordt gehanteerd om de leeftijdsgrens te bewaken en aan de geldende verplichtingen te voldoen;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">de wijze waarop deze werkwijze bekend en inzichtelijk wordt gemaakt voor medewerkers; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">de controle op de juiste naleving van het proces en de wijze waarop eventuele correcties worden doorgevoerd.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Hoe 247DRANK, samen met eventuele ketenpartners (bezorgdiensten), de leeftijdsgrens bewaakt van bestelling van dranken tot en met de bezorging; </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Hoe 247DRANK ervoor zorgt dat de werkwijze duidelijke en helder kenbaar wordt gemaakt voor medewerkers, eigen bezorgers en/of anderen die werkzaam zijn onder de verantwoordelijkheid van 247DRANK. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Hoe 247DRANK controleert op de juiste naleving van de geborgde werkwijze en hoe, naar aanleiding van evaluaties van de werkwijze, eventuele veranderingen worden doorgevoerd. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span>

<h1 style="margin-left:1px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-size:18.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Proces (conform artikel 5.2, lid 1 onder a en b van het Alcoholbesluit) </span></span></span></span></span></span></h1>
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Bij online bestellingen is het verplicht dat de koper aangeeft tenminste 18 jaar en ouder te zijn. Bij telefonische bevestiging van de bestelling wordt gevraagd of de koper 18 jaar of ouder is. Tevens wordt in alle gevallen aan de klant gemeld dat bij aflevering degene die het dranken pakket in ontvangst neemt 18 jaar of ouder moet zijn en zich desgevraagd ook dient te legitimeren. Tijdens het bestel proces zal er een IDIN check en 18+ bevestiging plaats vinden. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Bij aflevering door externe bezorgdiensten zal altijd een leeftijdscheck gedaan worden. De ontvanger dient een geldig identiteitsbewijs te tonen, conform artikel 20 lid 2 van de Alcoholwet. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">De eigen bezorgdienst van 247DRANK controleert bij aflevering de geboortedatum aan de hand van de aflevergegevens &eacute;n het ID-bewijs dat u gereed houdt. Wanneer u reeds door eerdere controle van de eigen bezorger ge&iuml;dentificeerd bent en u wordt herkend door de eigen bezorger en/of het is evident dat u ouder bent dan 25 jaar, dan kan dit ook als verificatie worden gezien. Legitimatie op verzoek van de bezorger blijft echter te allen tijde verplicht. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Afleveren bij de buren, of dranken achterlaten zonder dat er iemand thuis is, is niet toegestaan. Het dranken pakket zal weer door de bezorger meegenomen worden. Bij eigen bezorging worden de dranken retour genomen worden en opnieuw ter&nbsp; bezorging aangeboden worden. De extra kosten zijn voor rekening van de koper. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;</span></span></span>

<h1 style="margin-left:1px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-size:18.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Informatievoorziening medewerkers (conform artikel 5.2, lid 1 onder c van het Alcoholbesluit) </span></span></span></span></span></span></h1>
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Al onze medewerkers zijn ge&iuml;nformeerd betreffende deze geborgde werkwijze door middel van handboeken, interne trainingen en werkoverleggen en worden hier regelmatig op gecontroleerd. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;
<h1 style="margin-left:1px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-size:18.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Controle (conform artikel 5.2, lid 1 onder d van het Alcoholbesluit) </span></span></span></span></span></span></h1>
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Maandelijks worden bij alle bezorgers zowel intern als extern de geborgde werkwijze ge&euml;valueerd en waar nodig bijgestuurd. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Bij bezorging door interne of externe partijen wordt steekproefsgewijs gecontroleerd of de vereiste leeftijdscheck wordt nageleefd. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">&nbsp;</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><span style="font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#595959">Meer weten over verantwoord alcoholgebruik?<br />
nix18.nl </span></span></span></span></span><br />
